      "ownerDescr" : "Delivers the data for a client master record.\n\nThe delivered response structure is defined accordingly with the value of the attribute *useCase*.\n\nThe current resource version of the client master record is delivered in the response header *etag*.\nThis resource version must be delivered in the case of a subsequent modification of the client master record to ensure optimistic locking.\n\nSample request: GET /banks/949/clients/123456789"
