      "ownerDescr" : "Opens a new account or modifies an existing account.\nWhen a new account is opened, the Request-Id needs to be provided in the header.\nIn the case of a modification, the If-Match parameter needs to be provided in the header.\n\n**Important note** for updates: Missing attributes in the request body are updated to NULL.\nAll attributes that are not to be changed need to be provided in the request body.\n\nMandatory fields (opening):\n- portfolioKey\n- accountCurrency\n- accountType\n\nMandatory fields (change):\n- none (**but missing attributes are updated to NULL**)\n\nSample request: PUT /banks/949/clients/123456789/accounts/234567890"
