      "ownerDescr" : "Prepares the order of a **new** Viseca debit card based on the given data set.\nThe resulting order is not yet sent to Viseca, it is just stored on the server under the status 'ready for processing'.\n\nCorresponding template data needs to be obtained beforehand by using:\nGET /banks/{bankNumber}/viseca/debit/cards/orders/defaults\n\nAfterwards, the final submission of the prepared order to Viseca can be triggered by the call:\nPOST /banks/{bankNumber}/omnia/cards/orders/approvals/{cardOrderKey}\n\nSample request: POST /banks/949/viseca/debit/cards/orders/defaults"
    },
