      "topicName" : "valiant-fil-is-pensionPlanV1.PutInvestmentPlansInvestmentPlanKey",
      "ownerDescr" : "This function can be used to adjust the plan details for PMS+ plans.\nThe plan must have the status 'In progress'.\nModifications are only possible if control code 'C' (Override at plan level permitted) is set.\nThe plan no. can only be modified if the program parameter [PP] GENERATE_PLAN_NR has been disabled.\nThe instructions are regenerated if the investment objective is modified.\nThese can be read again with GET instructions.\nThis interface implements data security with full access.\nThis means that the user has full access rights to the plan portfolio.\n\nSample request: PUT /banks/949/clients/65261026703571/investmentplans/2948729385641"
