      "topicName" : "valiant-fil-is-pensionPlanV1.PutInvestmentPlansInvestmentPlanKeyInstructions",
      "ownerDescr" : "This function can be used to adjust the instructions for investment plans.\n This means that you can provide a list of securities and their weighting via P_PaPlanInstruktion\n and a new reporting date is created with the new breakdown as of the current date.\n In addition, the previous instructions are set to the status 'Invalid'.\n Only plans of the type 'Template' that\n are in status 'In progress' or 'Being entered' can be changed.\n A collection with all instructions and their securities weightings is returned.\n\nSample request: PUT /banks/949/clients/65261026703571/investmentplans/2948729385641/instructions"
