      "topicName" : "valiant-fil-is-portfolioAttributesV2.advisors.PutAdvisorAssignmentKey",
      "ownerDescr" : "Change of the advisor assignments of a client's portfolio.\n\n- If the portfolio is the main portfolio, then all advisors of the appropriate sub-portfolios are updated.\n- Appropriate sub-portfolios are portfolios that have the exact same advisor constellation as the main portfolio.\n- The function can also be used for updating the client advisor. In this case, it must be the advisor of the main portfolio.\n- If an OU is entered as advisor, the individual members of this OU cannot be modified but rather only the OU as a whole.\n\nSample request: PUT banks/949/clients/57875920769136/portfolio/123456789/advisors/123456789"
