    {
      "id" : "valiant.mkk.domain.openMkk.v1.ExtractClientKey.In",
      "name" : "ExtractClientKey.In",
      "pkg" : "valiant.mkk.domain.openMkk.v1",
      "kind" : "case",
      "owner" : "ExtractClientKey",
      "importPath" : "valiant.mkk.domain.openMkk.v1.ExtractClientKey",
      "source" : "valiant-mkk/01-domain/src/main/scala/valiant/mkk/domain/openMkk/v1/ExtractClientKey.scala",
      "imports" : [
        "valiant.graviton.domain.account.v1.schema.Account",
        "schema.*"
      ],
      "fields" : [
        {
          "name" : "accounts",
          "type" : "Seq[Account]",
          "description" : "Accounts from the Graviton GetAccounts Service",
          "example" : "Seq(Account.example)"
        },
        {
          "name" : "rentalParty",
          "type" : "RentalParty",
          "description" : "The landlord rental party data used for matching",
          "example" : "RentalParty.landlordCompaniesAndOther"
        }
      ],
      "topicName" : "valiant-mkk-openMkkV1-ExtractClientKey",
      "dsl" : "CustomTask",
      "ownerDescr" : "Extracts from the accounts of the Graviton GetAccounts Service the clientKey:\n\nlandlordClientKey soll nur gesetzt werden, wenn response.customer.isActive == true und:\n\n(wenn clientMainType == \"PrivateIndividual\"):\n\n```\ncustomer.lastName == INPUT.lastName\ncustomer.firstName == INPUT.firstName\ncustomer.birthDate == INPUT.birthDate\n```\n\noder (wenn clientMainType == \"severalPrivateIndividuals\"):\n\n```\ncustomer.lastName == INPUT.lastName\n\ncustomer.firstName == INPUT.firstName\ncustomer.birthDate == INPUT.birthDate\n\ncustomer.lastNamePartner == INPUT.partnerLastName\ncustomer.firstNamePartner ==  INPUT.partnerFirstName\ncustomer.birthDatePartner == INPUT.partnerBirthDate\n```\n\noder (wenn clientMainType == \"companiesAndOther\"):\n\n```\ncustomer.lastName == INPUT.lastName\n\ncustomer.legalAdress.zipCode == INPUT.currentAdress.postCode\n\ncustomer.legalAdress.street == INPUT.currentAdress.street + INPUT.currentAdress.houseNumber\n\ncustomer.legalAdress.city == INPUT.currentAdress.place\n\ncustomer.companyId == INPUT.uid\n```\n\nfalls UID nicht erfasst im Finnova und Name sowie Adresse übereinstimmen trotzdem übernehmen - falls UID erfasst und nicht gleich wie Input nicht übernehmen\n\nsonst landlordClientKey = null"
    },
    {
      "id" : "valiant.mkk.domain.openMkk.v1.ExtractClientKey.Out",
      "name" : "ExtractClientKey.Out",
      "pkg" : "valiant.mkk.domain.openMkk.v1",
      "kind" : "case",
      "owner" : "ExtractClientKey",
      "importPath" : "valiant.mkk.domain.openMkk.v1.ExtractClientKey",
      "source" : "valiant-mkk/01-domain/src/main/scala/valiant/mkk/domain/openMkk/v1/ExtractClientKey.scala",
      "imports" : [
        "valiant.graviton.domain.account.v1.schema.Account",
        "schema.*"
      ],
      "fields" : [
        {
          "name" : "rentalPartyClientKey",
          "type" : "Option[Long]",
          "description" : "The clientKey of the first landlord/renter account, or null if no match was found",
          "example" : "Some(defaultClientKey)"
        },
        {
          "name" : "severalMatches",
          "type" : "Boolean",
          "description" : "Flag that indicates that more than one  account was matched",
          "example" : "false"
        }
      ],
      "topicName" : "valiant-mkk-openMkkV1-ExtractClientKey",
      "dsl" : "CustomTask",
      "ownerDescr" : "Extracts from the accounts of the Graviton GetAccounts Service the clientKey:\n\nlandlordClientKey soll nur gesetzt werden, wenn response.customer.isActive == true und:\n\n(wenn clientMainType == \"PrivateIndividual\"):\n\n```\ncustomer.lastName == INPUT.lastName\ncustomer.firstName == INPUT.firstName\ncustomer.birthDate == INPUT.birthDate\n```\n\noder (wenn clientMainType == \"severalPrivateIndividuals\"):\n\n```\ncustomer.lastName == INPUT.lastName\n\ncustomer.firstName == INPUT.firstName\ncustomer.birthDate == INPUT.birthDate\n\ncustomer.lastNamePartner == INPUT.partnerLastName\ncustomer.firstNamePartner ==  INPUT.partnerFirstName\ncustomer.birthDatePartner == INPUT.partnerBirthDate\n```\n\noder (wenn clientMainType == \"companiesAndOther\"):\n\n```\ncustomer.lastName == INPUT.lastName\n\ncustomer.legalAdress.zipCode == INPUT.currentAdress.postCode\n\ncustomer.legalAdress.street == INPUT.currentAdress.street + INPUT.currentAdress.houseNumber\n\ncustomer.legalAdress.city == INPUT.currentAdress.place\n\ncustomer.companyId == INPUT.uid\n```\n\nfalls UID nicht erfasst im Finnova und Name sowie Adresse übereinstimmen trotzdem übernehmen - falls UID erfasst und nicht gleich wie Input nicht übernehmen\n\nsonst landlordClientKey = null"
    },
