      "id" : "valiant.onboarding.domain.directActivation.DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory.In",
      "name" : "DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory.In",
      "pkg" : "valiant.onboarding.domain.directActivation",
      "kind" : "case",
      "owner" : "DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory",
      "importPath" : "valiant.onboarding.domain.directActivation.DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory",
      "source" : "valiant-onboarding/01-domain/src/main/scala/valiant/onboarding/domain/directActivation/DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory.scala",
      "fields" : [
        {
          "name" : "processInstanceId",
          "type" : "String",
          "description" : "The Camunda process instance ID used to query history variables.",
          "example" : "\"abc123-def456-proc-001\""
        }
      ],
      "topicName" : "valiant-onboarding-directActivation.DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory",
      "dsl" : "CustomTask",
      "ownerDescr" : "Deletes local `clientKey` variable instances from Camunda history that were created\nin sub-executions (e.g. PoA check loop iterations) of the current process instance.\n\nThe Groovy history service call is:\n```\nhistoryService\n  .createHistoricVariableInstanceQuery()\n  .processInstanceId(processInstanceId)\n  .variableName(\"clientKey\")\n  .list()\n  .findAll { it.getExecutionId() != processInstanceId }\n  .each { historyService.deleteHistoricVariableInstance(it.getId()) }\n```\nTODO: Remove when fixed in BPF"
    },
    {
      "id" : "valiant.onboarding.domain.directActivation.DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory.Out",
      "name" : "DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory.Out",
      "pkg" : "valiant.onboarding.domain.directActivation",
      "kind" : "member",
      "owner" : "DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory",
      "importPath" : "valiant.onboarding.domain.directActivation.DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory",
      "source" : "valiant-onboarding/01-domain/src/main/scala/valiant/onboarding/domain/directActivation/DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory.scala",
      "topicName" : "valiant-onboarding-directActivation.DeleteLocalClientKeyVariablesFromHistory",
      "dsl" : "CustomTask",
      "ownerDescr" : "Deletes local `clientKey` variable instances from Camunda history that were created\nin sub-executions (e.g. PoA check loop iterations) of the current process instance.\n\nThe Groovy history service call is:\n```\nhistoryService\n  .createHistoricVariableInstanceQuery()\n  .processInstanceId(processInstanceId)\n  .variableName(\"clientKey\")\n  .list()\n  .findAll { it.getExecutionId() != processInstanceId }\n  .each { historyService.deleteHistoricVariableInstance(it.getId()) }\n```\nTODO: Remove when fixed in BPF"
    },
