      "ownerDescr" : "Port of scripts/orderEBankingContract/create.allPoaStatus90.groovy.\n\nDifferences vs Groovy:\n - The Groovy script referenced accountHolderKey ?: accountHolderClientKey (MAP-6873).\n   Our AssignmentAccount schema provides only accountHolderClientKey, so we use that.\n - Groovy stored missingPoaClientKeys as JSON(Set). We provide typed MissingPoa list.\n\nOutputs (process variables):\n - allPoaStatus90 (Boolean)  // matches BPMN\n - clientPoas (Seq[PoaEnhancedResult])      // debug parity\n - accountPoas (Seq[PoaEnhancedResult])     // debug parity\n - missingPoas (Seq[MissingPoa])            // typed output\n - basisContractNotNeeded (Boolean)"
