        {
          "name" : "startedBefore",
          "type" : "Option[CamundaDateTime]",
          "description" : "Restrict to instances that were started before the given date.\nBy [default](https://docs.camunda.org/manual/7.20/reference/rest/overview/date-format/), the date must have the format `yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss.SSSZ`, e.g., `2013-01-23T14:42:45.000+0200`.\n- Format: date-time",
