    {
      "id" : "valiant.vollmacht.domain.loadPoas.v1.GetDetailsForPoas.In",
      "name" : "GetDetailsForPoas.In",
      "pkg" : "valiant.vollmacht.domain.loadPoas.v1",
      "kind" : "case",
      "owner" : "GetDetailsForPoas",
      "importPath" : "valiant.vollmacht.domain.loadPoas.v1.GetDetailsForPoas",
      "source" : "valiant-vollmacht/01-domain/src/main/scala/valiant/vollmacht/domain/loadPoas/v1/GetDetailsForPoas.scala",
      "imports" : [
        "valiant.fil.is.domain.accountAndPortfolio.v3.schema.Account",
        "valiant.fil.is.domain.address.v2.schema.Address",
        "valiant.fil.is.domain.poa.v3.GetPoaPoaKey",
        "valiant.fil.is.domain.poa.v3.schema.AssignmentClientExtended",
        "valiant.fil.is.domain.poa.v3.schema.PowerOfAttorney",
        "valiant.vollmacht.domain.loadPoas.v1.schema.PoaResult",
        "valiant.vollmacht.domain.loadPoas.v1.schema.receivedPoa"
      ],
      "fields" : [
        {
          "name" : "clientKey",
          "type" : "Long",
          "example" : "defaultClientKey"
        },
        {
          "name" : "poas",
          "type" : "Seq[PowerOfAttorney]",
          "example" : "Seq(PowerOfAttorney.example)"
        },
        {
          "name" : "poaTypes",
          "type" : "Option[Seq[Int]]",
          "description" : "From _LoadPoas.In.poaTypes_: Filter for the PoA types. If set, only PoAs with these types are returned.",
          "example" : "None"
        },
        {
          "name" : "poaStatuses",
          "type" : "Option[Seq[Int]]",
          "description" : "From _LoadPoas.In.poaStatuses_: Filter for the PoA statuses. If set, only PoAs with these statuses are returned.",
          "example" : "None"
        },
        {
          "name" : "signingAuthorities",
          "type" : "Option[Seq[Int]]",
          "description" : "From _LoadPoas.In.signingAuthorities_.",
          "example" : "None"
        },
        {
          "name" : "legitimations",
          "type" : "Option[Seq[Int]]",
          "description" : "From _LoadPoas.In.legitimations_",
          "example" : "None"
        },
        {
          "name" : "signbaseStatuses",
          "type" : "Option[Seq[Int]]",
          "description" : "From _LoadPoas.In.signbaseStatuses_",
          "example" : "None"
        },
        {
          "name" : "getDetailsForReceivedPoas",
          "type" : "Boolean",
          "description" : "From _LoadPoas.In.getDetailsForReceivedPoas_: If you also need the details of the received PoAs.",
          "example" : "false"
        },
        {
          "name" : "doFilterDetails",
          "type" : "Boolean",
          "description" : "From _LoadPoas.In.doFilterDetails_: If you don't need the address and client information.",
          "example" : "true"
        },
        {
          "name" : "loadAccounts",
          "type" : "Boolean",
          "description" : "From _LoadPoas.In.loadAccounts_: If you also need the accounts for the PoAs.",
          "example" : "true"
        },
        {
          "name" : "ignoreCodesCache",
          "type" : "Option[Boolean]",
          "description" : "A way to invalidate ignore the codes cache (set to true). Default is `false`.",
          "example" : "None"
        }
      ],
      "topicName" : "valiant-vollmacht-loadPoasV1-GetDetailsForPoas",
      "dsl" : "CustomTask",
      "ownerDescr" : "Get Details for Power of Attorneys\n\nThis worker enriches the Power of Attorneys with detailed information from various FIL IS services.\n\n### Functionality\nFor each Power of Attorney, this task:\n1. **Retrieves client information** including:\n   - Client designation (long and short forms)\n   - Client type (privateIndividual, company, etc.)\n   - Nationality\n   - Date of birth\n   - Person details (form of address, first name, name, marital status, etc.)\n\n2. **Loads addresses** for authorized persons:\n   - Mailing addresses from FIL IS Address API (v2)\n   - Converted to Graviton-compatible format\n\n3. **Optionally loads associated accounts** (if `loadAccounts = true`):\n   - Account details from FIL IS Account API (v3)\n   - Filtered for active accounts\n   - Includes account keys, types, and assignment information\n\n4. **Applies filters** based on input parameters:\n   - PoA types (e.g., 102, 302, 6026)\n   - PoA statuses (e.g., 90 for active)\n   - Signing authorities\n   - Legitimations\n   - Signbase statuses\n\n5. **Categorizes PoAs** into:\n   - **Given PoAs**: Where `poaClientKey = assignmentClients[0].clientKey`\n   - **Received PoAs**: Where `poaClientKey = poa.clientAssignedKey`\n\n### Data Enrichment\nEach PoA is enriched with:\n- `clientDesignationLong`: Full client designation\n- `clientDesignation`: Short client designation\n- `clientType`: Type of client (privateIndividual, company, etc.)\n- `nationality`: Client nationality code\n- `dateOfBirth`: Client date of birth\n- `person`: Detailed person information (if applicable)\n- `addresses`: List of mailing addresses\n- `assignmentAccounts`: List of associated accounts (if `loadAccounts = true`)\n- `legitimation`: Legitimation level from assignmentClients\n- `signingAuthority`: Signing authority level\n- `signbaseStatus`: Signbase status code\n\n### Output Structure\n- **allPoas**: Complete list with all details and filters applied\n- **givenPoas**: Filtered list of PoAs granted by the client\n- **receivedPoas**: Filtered list of PoAs received by the client\n\n### Performance Considerations\n- Uses caching for code lookups (can be invalidated with `ignoreCodesCache = true`)\n- Processes PoAs in parallel where possible\n- Filters are applied early to reduce data processing"
    },
    {
      "id" : "valiant.vollmacht.domain.loadPoas.v1.GetDetailsForPoas.Out",
      "name" : "GetDetailsForPoas.Out",
      "pkg" : "valiant.vollmacht.domain.loadPoas.v1",
      "kind" : "case",
      "owner" : "GetDetailsForPoas",
      "importPath" : "valiant.vollmacht.domain.loadPoas.v1.GetDetailsForPoas",
      "source" : "valiant-vollmacht/01-domain/src/main/scala/valiant/vollmacht/domain/loadPoas/v1/GetDetailsForPoas.scala",
      "imports" : [
        "valiant.fil.is.domain.accountAndPortfolio.v3.schema.Account",
        "valiant.fil.is.domain.address.v2.schema.Address",
        "valiant.fil.is.domain.poa.v3.GetPoaPoaKey",
        "valiant.fil.is.domain.poa.v3.schema.AssignmentClientExtended",
        "valiant.fil.is.domain.poa.v3.schema.PowerOfAttorney",
        "valiant.vollmacht.domain.loadPoas.v1.schema.PoaResult",
        "valiant.vollmacht.domain.loadPoas.v1.schema.receivedPoa"
      ],
      "fields" : [
        {
          "name" : "allPoas",
          "type" : "Seq[PoaResult]",
          "example" : "Seq(PoaResult.example, receivedPoa)"
        },
        {
          "name" : "givenPoas",
          "type" : "Seq[PoaResult]",
          "example" : "Seq(PoaResult.example)"
        },
        {
          "name" : "receivedPoas",
          "type" : "Seq[PoaResult]",
          "example" : "Seq(receivedPoa)"
        }
      ],
      "topicName" : "valiant-vollmacht-loadPoasV1-GetDetailsForPoas",
      "dsl" : "CustomTask",
      "ownerDescr" : "Get Details for Power of Attorneys\n\nThis worker enriches the Power of Attorneys with detailed information from various FIL IS services.\n\n### Functionality\nFor each Power of Attorney, this task:\n1. **Retrieves client information** including:\n   - Client designation (long and short forms)\n   - Client type (privateIndividual, company, etc.)\n   - Nationality\n   - Date of birth\n   - Person details (form of address, first name, name, marital status, etc.)\n\n2. **Loads addresses** for authorized persons:\n   - Mailing addresses from FIL IS Address API (v2)\n   - Converted to Graviton-compatible format\n\n3. **Optionally loads associated accounts** (if `loadAccounts = true`):\n   - Account details from FIL IS Account API (v3)\n   - Filtered for active accounts\n   - Includes account keys, types, and assignment information\n\n4. **Applies filters** based on input parameters:\n   - PoA types (e.g., 102, 302, 6026)\n   - PoA statuses (e.g., 90 for active)\n   - Signing authorities\n   - Legitimations\n   - Signbase statuses\n\n5. **Categorizes PoAs** into:\n   - **Given PoAs**: Where `poaClientKey = assignmentClients[0].clientKey`\n   - **Received PoAs**: Where `poaClientKey = poa.clientAssignedKey`\n\n### Data Enrichment\nEach PoA is enriched with:\n- `clientDesignationLong`: Full client designation\n- `clientDesignation`: Short client designation\n- `clientType`: Type of client (privateIndividual, company, etc.)\n- `nationality`: Client nationality code\n- `dateOfBirth`: Client date of birth\n- `person`: Detailed person information (if applicable)\n- `addresses`: List of mailing addresses\n- `assignmentAccounts`: List of associated accounts (if `loadAccounts = true`)\n- `legitimation`: Legitimation level from assignmentClients\n- `signingAuthority`: Signing authority level\n- `signbaseStatus`: Signbase status code\n\n### Output Structure\n- **allPoas**: Complete list with all details and filters applied\n- **givenPoas**: Filtered list of PoAs granted by the client\n- **receivedPoas**: Filtered list of PoAs received by the client\n\n### Performance Considerations\n- Uses caching for code lookups (can be invalidated with `ignoreCodesCache = true`)\n- Processes PoAs in parallel where possible\n- Filters are applied early to reduce data processing"
    },
    {
      "id" : "valiant.vollmacht.domain.loadPoas.v1.LoadPoas.In",
